%% Vet appointment booking — decisions 0004 (confirmation model) and 0005 (unified bookings)
flowchart TD
  A[Select Pet] --> B[Choose Provider]
  B --> C[Choose Service]
  C --> D[Select Slot]
  D --> E[Add Notes / Review Policy & Price]
  E --> M{Service confirmation mode}
  M -- instant --> F[Mock Payment / Confirm]
  F --> G{Slot still available?}
  G -- No --> H[Show Conflict / Choose New Slot]
  H --> D
  G -- Yes --> I[Booking Confirmed]
  M -- request --> R[Submit Request: status pending_provider, slot held]
  R --> P{Provider responds before deadline?}
  P -- Confirms --> RP[Mock Payment] --> I
  P -- Declines --> X[Declined: suggest alternatives]
  P -- No response --> Y[Expired: slot released, suggest alternatives]
  I --> J[Reminder]
  J --> K[Check-in / Service Completed]
  K --> L[Review]
